@title Long Issues rows wrap beside their triangle (1920x1080)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# Regression from T0b: the Issues rows lost their wrapping; a long message ran off the edge. Each row wraps in the width left after the triangle.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "place macro"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click 1759 103
wait 4
text motor starter dol
wait 5
click_text "Motor starter DOL" Label
wait 10
click_text Place Button
wait 30
expect_scene "-K1"
click_text "warnings" Button
wait 10
shot issues-long-rows
check_layout
